flowchart TD
    U[User research request] --> P[Research planner]
    P --> S[Agent state and bounded research loop]
    S --> D[Validated tool dispatcher]
    D --> T[Search and retrieval]
    D --> C[Calculations and company comparisons]
    T --> E[Source store and evidence collector]
    C --> E
    E --> V[Evidence store with provenance]
    V --> R[Report generator]
    R --> Q[Quality control]
    Q --> H{Human review}
    H -->|Approve| A[Recorded approval gate]
    A --> PUB[Report publisher]
    H -->|Reject| X[Rejected; no publication]
    H -->|More research or scope change| S
